ed Burger King as well  in case you were a Burger King guy not a  McDonald's guy people found a reason to  be upset about it  because they always find a reason  especially as a pertains to  Trump but really I mean first of all I  have long suggested that McDonald's  should have a buffet restaurant there  should be there should be Mick buffets  and they should look exactly like this  feast  so people have always called me crazy  for some but now you can look at this  and now you see what I'm saying right I  mean that would be great  it'll be a great kind and I'm talking  about a fancy like like what Donald  Trump did a fancy Mick buffet um so that  you could go there for your wedding  anniversary or you know a first date you  really want to impress a girl bring it  to the McDonald's buffet and you could  say to her hey have two Big Macs if you  want but secondly what what man what  football player what American wouldn't  love to be presented with a silver  platter filled with Big Mac and fish  fillets I mean anyone would love that I  have in my time been to many fancy bank  went banquet type things and I've had a  lot of fancy banquet food and I can't  think of a single one of those events  that would not have been vastly improved  by Big Macs I actually think that the  typical fancy banquet food is is usually  really disappointing the chicken tastes  like rubber the beef is always  overcooked they get way too fancy they  try way too hard portions aren't big  enough I would just take a Big Mac so I  actually think in all seriousness this  is although the left is making fun of  him for it of course I think this is  probably the most endearing thing that  Trump has ever done and if I ever went  to visit Donald Trump before some sort  of fancy lunch and McDonald's was not  served I would be thoroughly  disappointed this is exactly what I  would expect and I would be thrilled by  it alright we'll leave it there have a  great day everybody we'll talk to you  tomorrow  God